nDate:   Wed Nov 18 07:02:43 2026 +0100\n\n    Distribution tests on the packed tarballs; sizes measured: far over target\n    \n    By Claude Opus 5.5 (high). Both packages are packed and unpacked into\n    three clean fixtures that resolve them only through their exports. Tests:\n    the three first-chart snippets (10 lines or fewer) render from the packed\n    files; package contents, declarations, conditions and side effects; Node\n    import and validate() without a DOM; server rendering and hydration; a\n    strict Content-Security-Policy served with real headers (no violations in\n    8 page variants); text never becomes HTML; licences and notices.\n    Coordinator runs: 83 Node and 18 browser distribution tests pass.\n    \n    Sizes from the packed files (esbuild, gzip 9): everything 97.75 KiB\n    against a 40 KiB target; line only 97.61 KiB against 25; React adapter\n    1.17 KiB against 2. Chart types do not tree-shake: importing only line\n    saves 137 bytes. The size check is reported in CI but does not gate it\n    yet. Package 'files' lists narrowed (96 files shipped before, 10 now);\n    sideEffects now names the CSS. Licence holder is written as 'The Axylo\n    authors' pending the owner's wording. Not verified: other bundlers, a\n    registry install, Windows and macOS paths in the pack script.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .github/workflows/ci.yml                  |   6 +\n .gitignore                                |   6 +\n THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md                    |  26 ++\n bench/size-latest.json                    | 485 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n examples/first-chart/npm.ts               |  10 +\n examples/first-chart/react.tsx            |  12 +\n examples/first-chart/script.html          |  10 +\n package.json                              |   6 +-\n packages/axylo/LICENSE                    |  21 ++\n packages/axylo/README.md                  |  62 ++++\n packages/axylo/package.json          